<title>USA: Iron Mountain says buys Business Records.</title>
<headline>Iron Mountain says buys Business Records.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iron Mountain Inc said Monday it acquired Business Records Center Inc in Wisconsin.</p>
<p>The company said it has completed 30 acquisitions since it launched its acquisition program in mid-1994.</p>
<p>No further information was immediately available from the company.</p>
